eenshot5_Results.png", "id": "1080932576747282", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974663_1080932580080615_8251626787664545730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jkitMrCrasEQ7kNvwFybuNa&_nc_oc=Adrbvjl0zzU5DolP8FjPyL9w3W4zSD2tbIJy9gEm5UQeOjoCplAe6C9V_hUMyQ0QLMs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQvk_cnMyLaefJNX1et-KJTt_2m67QX8FGNacapKeqNrA&oe=6B0478D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Screenshot 5.png", "id": "741884041275048", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974683_741884044608381_7497954385267470395_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jzbHLMMv05kQ7kNvwHGyz8B&_nc_oc=AdoXsIuFv-2C2LBn6wQY8RbGyaSbHeHbnvBx0w_gzfbD6U7R04h7LqCsnjTvn5rXjCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRuwp7huZFzXDTpEznYdNJjzLZKViGGcXGbImJNrz0YwA&oe=6B0475D3"}, "display_name": "Engage Your Audience", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock Your Full Potential with Our Presentation Skills Training\n\nAre you looking to enhance your presentation skills and become a more confident and effective communicator? Our innovative presentation skills training program is here to help. Utilizing the latest advancements in Virtual Reality (VR) technology, our simulation provides a realistic and immersive environment for you to practice and hone your presentation skills.\n\nRehearse with Confidence\n\nWith our VR simulation, you'll have the opportunity to rehearse your presentations in a lifelike setting, complete with a virtual audience and realistic distractions. This allows you to prepare for any situation, from boardroom meetings to conference keynotes. Our AI-powered feedback system provides you with instant analysis and constructive criticism after every rehearsal, helping you identify areas for improvement and track your progress over time.\n\nExpert Guidance from Presentation Skills Coaches\n\nBut that's not all - our team of experienced TEDx coaches are on hand to offer personalized tips, tricks, and guidance to help you refine your presentation skills. With years of experience in crafting and delivering compelling presentations, our coaches will help you develop a clear, concise, and engaging message that resonates with your audience.\n\n\nTake Your Presentation Skills to the Next Level\n\n\n", "short_description": "Presentation skills training. Learn presentation skills with our VR simulation. Get AI feedback after every rehearsal. Get personalised tips and tricks from our TEDx coaches to improve your presentation skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://insightsphere.co/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "InsightSphere", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.insightsphere.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9477771305586126"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1143859713921020"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2666597886846221"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1143859713921020"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1737541260, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1143859713921020"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {